    {
      "id": "MHoiALc0AxfrN_AqM2oNq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 437.3125,
      "y": 160.8203125,
      "width": 484.0010070800781,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 658456569,
      "version": 691,
      "versionNonce": 1735306457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789498749113,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Info: URL shortner shortnes the long URL provided to it\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- shorten the URL\n- Have custom expiration time for the URL\n- Redirect to long URL via the short URL\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- handle 1B users and be able to handle 100M URLs\n- Short URL should be highly available\n- Low latency Redirects\n- Generate Unique short URLs for every URL\n- Have Short URL Length\n\nOut of Scope\n- custom short URL\n- URL click analytics",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Info: URL shortner shortnes the long URL provided to it\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- shorten the URL\n- Have custom expiration time for the URL\n- Redirect to long URL via the short URL\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- handle 1B users and be able to handle 100M URLs\n- Short URL should be highly available\n- Low latency Redirects\n- Generate Unique short URLs for every URL\n- Have Short URL Length\n\nOut of Scope\n- custom short URL\n- URL click analytics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BreEHzjsJiRy8zudOcVOJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 968.09765625,
      "y": 157.1171875,
      "width": 413.6008605957031,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
