    {
      "id": "q-YdybhcCb9PPwxj2tzxb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 443.203125,
      "y": 1038.859375,
      "width": 1012.0022583007812,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 937707383,
      "version": 606,
      "versionNonce": 14243833,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789499239183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dives\n\nGenerating/Creating URL's (Code Generation)\n\nHow short should my URL be\n- 8 Chars\n\n1. Use Hashing\n- we would pick the URL and sanitize it and hash it & trim to make get 8 characters\n    - wwww.google.com/something --> sanitize it -> hash it --> <some_hashed_string> --> trim 8 chars --> save to DB\n- Collisions are possible here\n\n2. counter\n- have a redis counter\n- at each request, increase the counter and use the counter to generate a hash\n- use that has as the code\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dives\n\nGenerating/Creating URL's (Code Generation)\n\nHow short should my URL be\n- 8 Chars\n\n1. Use Hashing\n- we would pick the URL and sanitize it and hash it & trim to make get 8 characters\n    - wwww.google.com/something --> sanitize it -> hash it --> <some_hashed_string> --> trim 8 chars --> save to DB\n- Collisions are possible here\n\n2. counter\n- have a redis counter\n- at each request, increase the counter and use the counter to generate a hash\n- use that has as the code\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
